30: 
31: ROWS (kinds: control = the instrument's own liveness/signature; contract = pinned either way; symptom = HEAD red /
32: FIX green; the rate row is a BAND):
33:   quiet    nothing pending: IRR 0, ISR 0, poll byte 0x00, IMR 0.
34:   level    the ISA ns16550 (IRQ 4) level: IRR bit 4 set; ISR 0; `eoi noack` (EOI 0x64 with no acknowledge) leaves
35:            IRR bit 4 CLEAR in both columns (the legacy consume, see above); the level re-asserts within a tick.
